What problem was the project solving?
"Basically, our project was solving the problem of fragmented customer data in the automotive industry.

The company had customer data coming from multiple source systems.

The problem was that the same customer could exist in multiple systems, but their information was stored differently.

For example:
- One system might have the customer's old address.
- Another system might have the updated phone number.
- Another system might contain vehicle ownership details.
- Some systems might have duplicate or incomplete customer records.
Because of this, it was difficult to identify the same customer across all systems and get a complete picture of that customer.

So, our main goal was to bring all this data together, clean it, validate it, identify duplicate customers, and create one trusted customer record, also called a Golden Record.

We used Azure Databricks for data processing and Reltio MDM for customer matching and golden record management.

Finally, we made this trusted data available for reporting, APIs, and external partner systems.

