 Why do we need ODS?
 We need ODS because multiple downstream systems may consume this reconciled operational data, 
not just reporting systems.

The DIM layer comes later. It consumes trusted ODS data and builds consolidated dimensions 
and fact tables for analytical reporting and Power BI.

ODS maintains source-specific operational records after reconciliation with MDM/Reltio. 
It preserves source information, Reltio IDs, UCIDs, Crosswalk mappings, customer relationships, 
and handles inserts, updates, and deletes.

